  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG). Build the enabling environment for Investment into cities, energy, Infrastructure and Urban services for the poor in Uganda. RDEL ICF element.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG). Build the enabling environment for Investment into cities, energy, Infrastructure and Urban services for the poor in Uganda. RDEL ICF element. is a component of Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;2,186,867. It works in the following sector(s): Urban development and management, Waste management/disposal, Industrial development, Public sector policy and administrative management, Road transport, Transport policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
